        <div class="item"><h4>Workforce optimization</h4><p>Data-driven scheduling and resource allocation.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><h4>BPO strategy &amp; setup</h4><p>Advisory on hub architecture, technology selection and scalable growth.</p></div>
